what would really make a difference. And so I've seen all kinds of wellness things that don't get much uptake. I mean, people don't do them that much because it's really not the kind of thing that is helpful to that. It doesn't fit well within the kind of job they're doing and so forth. And, you know, you really need to check, you know, of all the many solutions that might be out there that will help people and make them feel better about doing the job, you to check first whether this is something they really want.

